#~ "mount belongs on a mirror is the"
#~ " library's business and not the "
#~ "cursor's. Seating it on a *body* "
#~ "keeps where it already is, since "
#~ "which hole of a mount a pedestal"
#~ " sits in is a choice made on"
#~ " the bench. Setting ``width`` or "
#~ "``height`` goes through ``resize``, which "
