#~ " ``pivot`` の既定は "
#~ ":py:func:`shape_centre<gtrace.mechanics.shape_centre>` "
#~ "、つまり形状のバウンディングボックスの中心である。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A **body's** turn is a different "
#~ "question and is not written into "
#~ "the shapes: a body's pose says "
#~ "where it stands and which way it"
#~ " faces, and the shapes are read "
#~ "in the frame it is written in. "
#~ "So a rectangle carried by a turned"
#~ " body still reaches the bench as "
#~ "the closed polyline of its four "
#~ "corners, which is what a DXF "
